                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "21ffa8cf-0c90-4ed0-b2c9-11063546f8f0",
                        "entry_id": "c8ee36ec-e554-30fc-a31a-71c2b14240ea",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "чину́шах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b76867d-f3d7-384c-9566-eff6ddb03dce",
                        "entry_id": "c8ee36ec-e554-30fc-a31a-71c2b14240ea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг., презр. чиновник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8c80a5b-cc2c-4d88-ab1c-9a5493378ea1",
                                "sense_id": "7b76867d-f3d7-384c-9566-eff6ddb03dce",
                                "text": "И взятки хапают, как прежние чинуши хапали, и людей стадами загоняют в тюрьмы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0f2715a-5bd0-4291-af10-b2d3f13769bc",
                                "sense_id": "7b76867d-f3d7-384c-9566-eff6ddb03dce",
                                "text": "Детишкам, которые играли и шумели под его окнами, этот мелкий чинуша, покраснев как клюква, кричал: «Я вас выселю в 24 часа!»"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c443da04-6013-4f10-b484-05945edd12a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "c8ee36ec-e554-30fc-a31a-71c2b14240ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b76867d-f3d7-384c-9566-eff6ddb03dce",
                        "target_lang_word": "bureaucrat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bureaucrat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "711e5f9a-3fc7-3e0e-ad9e-ebf4c5783f58",
                                        "entry_id": "86396514-d2a1-32f0-854d-dfb88cf47b48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An official who is part of a bureaucracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5024023b-74a1-435a-b79a-cc53346d67f8",
                                                "sense_id": "711e5f9a-3fc7-3e0e-ad9e-ebf4c5783f58",
                                                "text": "Coristine, who had signed onto the telemeeting using a non-government email address, gave the bureaucrats swift marching orders, telling them he needed access to the federal department’s contract and payment systems before reportedly making them justify their jobs at the $1 billion-budget administration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e94b6aa-a559-4444-98a7-69a659911ac4",
                                                "sense_id": "711e5f9a-3fc7-3e0e-ad9e-ebf4c5783f58",
                                                "text": "At the Oval Office signing ceremony, Musk responded to critiques that he’s become the very thing he claims to be fighting — an unelected bureaucrat with enormous power — by pointing to the 2024 results: “You couldn’t ask for a stronger mandate from the public.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b4201c4-7878-345e-b2ae-267c672be342",
                                        "entry_id": "86396514-d2a1-32f0-854d-dfb88cf47b48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A user on a wiki with the right to change user access levels."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0faf2bc5-4621-49e0-86dc-36c9ec5e361f",
                                                "sense_id": "3b4201c4-7878-345e-b2ae-267c672be342",
                                                "text": "One of three major processes is generally used: a bureaucrat review, a broader community review, or an approvals group review. As only local bureaucrats or Wikimedia stewards can grant the bot flag necessary to operate an authorized bot, the simplest method is to appeal directly to these individuals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9733d549-eb2f-4af3-b139-5c6714172fbb",
                        "source_entry_id": "c8ee36ec-e554-30fc-a31a-71c2b14240ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b76867d-f3d7-384c-9566-eff6ddb03dce",
                        "target_lang_word": "apparatchik",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apparatchik",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c95dad9-aee9-311d-9d8b-f788b197312e",
                                        "entry_id": "47ccc7cb-18c1-33ef-8663-4ae52e6dfe92",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the Soviet apparat; a Communist bureaucrat or agent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad1e5b12-6fb4-483f-9dc4-d2301b017b0f",
                                                "sense_id": "5c95dad9-aee9-311d-9d8b-f788b197312e",
                                                "text": "Whether conservatively toeing their Marx or boldly advocating such heretical Western-style reforms as the primacy of profits, every important planner, apparatchik and economist in Russia is caught up in Communism's greatest debate since Stalin set backward Russia on its cruel-but successful-forced march into the 20th century industrial world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cd56b05-c3a2-4c45-a3d9-f666f084a5de",
                                                "sense_id": "5c95dad9-aee9-311d-9d8b-f788b197312e",
                                                "text": "In these dire conditions the ambitious Serbo-Croatian Communist Party apparatchik Slobodan Milošević played the national card in Kosovo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45240870-21d8-3580-80be-74cb22c02eb2",
                                        "entry_id": "47ccc7cb-18c1-33ef-8663-4ae52e6dfe92",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A blindly loyal bureaucrat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21c13699-b246-48ef-a97e-cfe90473648e",
                                                "sense_id": "45240870-21d8-3580-80be-74cb22c02eb2",
                                                "text": "Mr. Gonzales came across as a dull-witted apparatchik incapable of running one of the most important departments in the executive branch. […] He delegated responsibility for purging their ranks to an inexperienced and incompetent assistant who, if that’s possible, was even more of a plodding apparatchik."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a0e0b18-96df-410e-b124-4c3122010684",
                                                "sense_id": "45240870-21d8-3580-80be-74cb22c02eb2",
                                                "text": "He's so outspoken, so little the Labour apparatchik, that Prime Minister Brown decides he can't send this voluble critic of Iraq invasion to sit at a UN occasion alongside George W Bush."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d18e026f-c8fb-469b-bf84-ef1601dad40c",
                                                "sense_id": "45240870-21d8-3580-80be-74cb22c02eb2",
                                                "text": "“Does France, a founder member of the EU, really want to be the country that sends the biggest battalion of far-right apparatchiks to the European parliament?” [Gabriel] Attal asked."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a6806fc-3b07-4f91-a085-3bd84a8d15d3",
                        "source_entry_id": "c8ee36ec-e554-30fc-a31a-71c2b14240ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b76867d-f3d7-384c-9566-eff6ddb03dce",
